# BioKey Citizen Science Study

## Project Goal
Investigate whether synchronized group meditation during sleep can influence:
- Sleep quality
- Heart rate variability (HRV)
- Subjective well-being
- Brain wave patterns (if EEG available)

## Study Design
- **Type:** Observational citizen science study
- **Duration:** 12 weeks (3 lunar cycles)
- **Participants:** Anyone with Android device + wearable
- **Registration:** Open (rolling enrollment)

## Requirements
- Android smartphone (version 8.0+)
- Wearable device (smartwatch, fitness tracker) OR
- BioKey device (if you have it)
- Commitment: 3 nights/week for 12 weeks

## How to Participate
1. Download BioKey app from Google Play
2. Register at osf.io/[project-link]
3. Complete baseline questionnaires
4. Follow meditation protocol
5. Upload data weekly

## What We Measure
- Sleep stages (from wearable)
- Heart rate & HRV
- Daily questionnaires (mood, energy, stress)
- Optional: EEG if you have compatible device

## Data Sharing
- Your data: De-identified, stored securely
- Results: Published openly (preprints + peer-review)
- Code: 100% open source (GPL v3)

